/**
@mainpage Single EK9500 Modbus TCP Gateway v1.8.0

@section overview Overview

This C11/POSIX service bridges permitted Modbus TCP masters to one Beckhoff
EK9500 EtherNet/IP station. Modbus Unit ID 1 provides 16 DI, 16 DO, 4 AI and
4 AO through the fixed EL1409, EL2409, EL3074 and EL4074 terminal sequence.

@section assembly PDO assembly

Input Assembly 129 is 30 bytes: 4-byte header, 2-byte DI, 16-byte AI and
8-byte AO status. Output Assembly 130 is 22 bytes: 4-byte header, 2-byte DO
and 16-byte AO REAL32 data.

@section scaling EL4074 scaling

The AO Modbus table contains four signed 16-bit commands at 0.01 mA/count.
The cyclic output is REAL32 in SI amperes:

@code
real32_amperes = (double)(int16_t)modbus_word / 100000.0;
@endcode

Thus register value 132 represents 1.320 mA and is encoded as 0.00132 A.

@section docs Documentation

README.md is the operational entry point. The docs directory contains the
register map, architecture, configuration, commissioning and troubleshooting
guides.
*/
